{"sections":[{"slug":"Killing形式","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Killing形式"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Killing <span lang=\"zh\">形式</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Killing 形式”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span></p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Lie代数","text":"Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Killing <span lang=\"zh\">形式是</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的双线性型</span>\n$$\r\nB(X,Y)=\\operatorname{tr}(\\operatorname{ad}_X\\operatorname{ad}_Y).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathfrak {gl}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Killing <span lang=\"zh\">形式为</span> $B(X,Y) = 2n\\operatorname{tr}(XY)-2\\operatorname{tr}(X)\\operatorname{tr}(Y)$.</li>\n<li>$\\mathfrak {sl}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Killing <span lang=\"zh\">形式为</span> $B(X,Y)=2n\\operatorname{tr}(XY)$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}